    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d131-a19">

                <pb facs="0254" n="908" xml:id="pg908"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 13 in 2 in No. 219.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Indorsement of Assistant Adjutant-General
                    Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Headquarters Department of Texas</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >San Antonio, Texas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-03-23"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 23,
                        1875</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>A true copy respectfully forwarded to the assistant adjutant Military Division of
                    the Missouri, for the information of the lieutenant-general commanding.</p>
                <closer><signed>J. H. TAYLOR,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Assistant
                            Adjutant-General</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>(In the absence of the brigadier-general commanding.)</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
